From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Vantage <asystech-chen@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 01 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Gecko - Disable mach telemetry initialization

Disables the background Glean telemetry initialization in mach_initialize.py,
which can deadlock (futex) and hang `mach configure` indefinitely.

Signed-off-by: Vantage <asystech-chen@users.noreply.github.com>
---
--- a/build/mach_initialize.py
+++ b/build/mach_initialize.py
@@ -399,7 +399,11 @@
         )
     else:
         telemetry_executor = ThreadPoolExecutor(max_workers=1)
-        driver._telemetry_future = telemetry_executor.submit(_create_telemetry)
+        # Vantage: Glean SDK initialization can deadlock (futex) on some
+        # systems, which makes `mach` hang forever in _run() while waiting on
+        # the telemetry future. Leave the future as None so that _run() skips
+        # the wait entirely.
+        driver._telemetry_future = None
 
         class _LazyResult:
             def result(self):
